+### §6.4 Body outcomes — retained cleanup contract
+
+The earlier cleanup contract is translated where session state no longer exists. Live Pending carries the §8 weighted-round item state. Replace every former scalar-confidence transfer with an item-state lifetime transfer; matching admission preserves its whole weighted-round state, including preference, success counters, evidence sum and FINAL. Admission does not force preference in; FINAL-out remains out.
