+## §7 PENDING AND EARLY CONFIDENCE
+
+Pending membership depends only on a live in-flight or awaiting-admission record, filtered by the existing rejection/probation/local-rejection rules. No per-height decode history or session-plus support exists. Own removal alone creates no support. Fetch/awaiting union reservation remains P=2*M+32.
