+Live Pending initializes preference out, cumulative success counts d[in]=d[out]=0, signed evidence S=0, and not FINAL. It collects eligible §8 observations while live. Admission joins W only through the §8 gate measured in rounds; the full state transfers unchanged on matching admission. A fresh admission with no live Pending lifetime starts preference in and zero counters. Pending never enters roots, candidate proofs, own raw cells, raw setSize or exclusions before admission. Ref=(A union Pending) minus FINAL-out IDs remains the decode reference.
+
